@startuml architecture-nearest-station-weather-target-flow
title Nearest Station Weather Target Architecture Flow

' note top of diagram
' Status: Planned
' Purpose: Persist station catalog and cache weather data so repeated requests do not always depend on live SMHI fetches.
' end note

actor User
participant "Weather History Page" as WeatherHistoryPage
participant "WeatherHistory UI" as WeatherHistoryUi
participant "Weather History API Route" as WeatherHistoryRoute
participant "Rain History Service" as RainHistoryService
database "Station Catalog Store" as StationCatalogStore
database "Weather Data Cache" as WeatherDataCache
participant "Weather Data Repository" as WeatherDataRepository
participant "SMHI API Client" as SmhiApiClient
participant "SMHI Open Data API" as SmhiOpenDataApi

User -> WeatherHistoryPage: Open dashboard page
WeatherHistoryPage -> WeatherHistoryUi: Render weather history feature
User -> WeatherHistoryUi: Enter coordinates or choose preset location
WeatherHistoryUi -> WeatherHistoryRoute: GET rainy-days with latitude and longitude
WeatherHistoryRoute -> WeatherHistoryRoute: Validate coordinates

alt Coordinates are invalid
  WeatherHistoryRoute --> WeatherHistoryUi: 400 Bad Request
  WeatherHistoryUi --> User: Show validation error
else Coordinates are valid
  WeatherHistoryRoute -> RainHistoryService: getHistoricalWeatherData(lat, lon)
  RainHistoryService -> StationCatalogStore: Load station catalog

  alt Station catalog missing or stale
    RainHistoryService -> WeatherDataRepository: Fetch station catalog from source
    WeatherDataRepository -> SmhiApiClient: Request station catalog data
    SmhiApiClient -> SmhiOpenDataApi: Fetch station catalog from SMHI
    SmhiOpenDataApi --> SmhiApiClient: Station catalog data
    SmhiApiClient --> WeatherDataRepository: Raw station catalog data
    WeatherDataRepository --> RainHistoryService: Parsed station catalog
    RainHistoryService -> StationCatalogStore: Store refreshed station catalog
  else Station catalog available
    StationCatalogStore --> RainHistoryService: Station catalog
  end

  RainHistoryService -> WeatherDataCache: Load cached weather data for nearest station request

  alt Cached weather data is missing or stale
    RainHistoryService -> WeatherDataRepository: Fetch weather measurements from source
    WeatherDataRepository -> SmhiApiClient: Request measurement data
    SmhiApiClient -> SmhiOpenDataApi: Fetch weather data from SMHI
    SmhiOpenDataApi --> SmhiApiClient: Measurement data
    SmhiApiClient --> WeatherDataRepository: Raw measurement data
    WeatherDataRepository --> RainHistoryService: Parsed weather data
    RainHistoryService -> WeatherDataCache: Store refreshed weather data
  else Cached weather data is available
    WeatherDataCache --> RainHistoryService: Cached weather data
  end

  alt Weather data is available
    RainHistoryService -> RainHistoryService: Select nearest stations and build API response
    RainHistoryService --> WeatherHistoryRoute: Rain and temperature response data
    WeatherHistoryRoute --> WeatherHistoryUi: 200 OK JSON response
    WeatherHistoryUi --> User: Render station info, charts, tables, and summary
  else Weather data could not be returned
    RainHistoryService --> WeatherHistoryRoute: Retrieval failure
    WeatherHistoryRoute --> WeatherHistoryUi: Error response
    WeatherHistoryUi --> User: Show error state
  end
end

@enduml